            "steam_appid": 456650,
            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/456650/extras/8d7a56d3b7f37ffbff4de03e4183f2d2.avif?t=1780853524\" width=578 height=371 /></span><br>Kewtia: Crystallite Hunt is a colorful 3D Platformer packed full of levels, playable characters, and boss fights!<br>Explore the Mattyverse in a big easter egg hunt as you collect Crystallites; strange objects full of energy created by the Kewtians!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Colorful 3D platforming with fun physics and sandbox elements<br></li><li>Tons of large, varied levels to explore<br></li><li>Lots of collectibles and unlocks<br></li><li>Many playable characters, with different abilities and stats <br></li><li>Characters and environments from all across the Mattyverse, which includes games like Super Gear Quest, Geneticognito, and Toadie's Adventure<br></li><li>Tons of boss fights<br></li><li>Future content updates</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/456650/extras/8d7a56d3b7f37ffbff4de03e4183f2d2.avif?t=1780853524\" width=578 height=371 /></span><br>Kewtia: Crystallite Hunt is a colorful 3D Platformer packed full of levels, playable characters, and boss fights!<br>Explore the Mattyverse in a big easter egg hunt as you collect Crystallites; strange objects full of energy created by the Kewtians!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Colorful 3D platforming with fun physics and sandbox elements<br></li><li>Tons of large, varied levels to explore<br></li><li>Lots of collectibles and unlocks<br></li><li>Many playable characters, with different abilities and stats <br></li><li>Characters and environments from all across the Mattyverse, which includes games like Super Gear Quest, Geneticognito, and Toadie's Adventure<br></li><li>Tons of boss fights<br></li><li>Future content updates</li></ul>",
            "short_description": "Explore the Mattyverse as you collect Crystallites in this 3D Platformer packed full of colorful levels, playable characters, and boss fights!",
